Package: tsBAR
Type: Package
Title: Broken Adaptive Ridge in Time-Series
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
  person("Orest", "Prifti", email = "orest.prifti@bancaditalia.it", role = c("aut","cre")),
  person("Luca", "Margaritella", email = "luca.margaritella@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
  person("Gianluca", "Cubadda", email = "cbdglc00@uniroma2.it", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Orest Prifti <orest.prifti@bancaditalia.it>
Description: Implements broken adaptive ridge estimation for linear 
	regressions and high-dimensional vector autoregressions using
	coordinatewise fixed-point thresholding. Provides regularization
	paths, information-criterion-based tuning, and forecasting tools,
	with computational routines implemented in C++ through Rcpp.
